er-042","block":"b-70fbb7fe1cc06ae2dbd0","layer":"original","quote":"先主定蜀，署儒林校尉","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-828637d672def3c35e16","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-872decdd14679d7ec83a","layer":"original","quote":"群卒，子巨颇传其术","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-9a31e2e0445b8980df85","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-70fbb7fe1cc06ae2dbd0","layer":"original","quote":"先主欲与曹公争汉中，问群。群对曰：“当得其地，不得其民也；若出偏军，必不利，当戒慎之","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-a7d8eefb54f959783f48","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-36a191e5867b8439da0f","layer":"pei","quote":"建安七年，越嶲有男子化为女人；时群言，哀帝时亦有此：将易代之祥也。至二十五年，献帝果封于山阳","attribution":"裴注·续汉书","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5414957d5a2b7c78d997","start":11,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-aed3ca6072d14b624da9","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-a888bbdc1d8be9884076","layer":"original","quote":"于庭中作小楼，家富多奴，常令奴更直于楼上视天灾〖5〗；才见一气，即白群，群自上楼观之，不避晨夜","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":32,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":15,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-b238bd4d6bb3cfb4adfb","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-7a053fe7d388236a173e","layer":"original","quote":"于是举群茂才","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":86,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-c60379001900e015d0e4","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-36a191e5867b8439da0f","layer":"pei","quote":"十七年十二月，星孛于五诸侯；群以为，西方专据土地者皆将失土","attribution":"裴注·续汉书","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5414957d5a2b7c78d997","start":103,"end":132,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-d0313051c822286b9fd6","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-36a191e5867b8439da0f","layer":"pei","quote":"十二年十月，有星孛于鹑尾，荆州分野；群以为，荆州牧将死而失土","attribution":"裴注·续汉书","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5414957d5a2b7c78d997","start":58,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o063c-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-98bb2c0b5125ea94653e","layer":"original","quote":"臣父群未亡时〖15〗，言西南数有黄气，直立数丈，见来积年〖16〗；时时有景云祥风〖17〗，从璇玑下来应之〖18〗：此为异瑞。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":318,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":260,"end":322,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-5723169744b8bc31668f","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-5723169744b8bc31668f","layer":"modern","quote":"〖15〗群：指周群。传见本书卷四十二。周群有子周巨，当在上表人之中，或因官位低而未列名。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-926cd053311ba01c313b","start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o063","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-98bb2c0b5125ea94653e","layer":"original","quote":"故议郎、阳泉〔亭〕侯刘豹，青衣侯向举，偏将军张裔、黄权，大司马属殷纯，益州别驾从事赵莋，治中从事杨洪，从事祭酒何宗，议曹从事杜琼，劝学从事张爽、尹默、谯周等上言〖5〗：“臣闻《河图》、《洛书》〖6〗，五经谶、纬〖7〗；孔子所甄〖8〗，验应自远〖9〗。谨案《洛书甄曜度》曰：‘赤三日德昌〖10〗，九世会备〖11〗，合为帝际。’《洛书宝号命》曰：‘天度帝道备称皇，以统握契〖12〗，百成不败。’《洛书录运期》曰：‘九侯七杰争，命民炊骸〖13〗，道路籍籍履人头〖14〗，谁使主者玄且来。’《孝经钩命决录》曰：‘帝三建九会备。’臣父群未亡时〖15〗，言西南数有黄气，直立数丈，见来积年〖16〗；时时有景云祥风〖17〗，从璇玑下来应之〖18〗：此为异瑞。又二十二年中〖19〗，数有气如旗，从西竟东，中天而行；《图》、《书》曰‘必有天子出其方〖20〗’。加是年太白、荧惑、填星〖21〗，常从岁星相追〖22〗。近汉初兴，五星从岁星聚〖23〗；岁星主义〖24〗，汉位在西，义之上方〖25〗：故汉法常以岁星候人主〖26〗，当有圣主起于此州，以致中兴。时许帝尚存〖27〗，故群下不敢漏言〖28〗。顷者荧惑复追岁星〖29〗，现在胃、昴、毕〖30〗；昴、毕为天纲〖31〗，《经》曰‘帝星处之，众邪消亡’。圣讳预睹〖32〗，推揆期验〖33〗；符合数至，若此非一。臣闻圣王先天而天不违〖34〗，后天而奉天时；故应际而生〖35〗，与神合契。愿大王应天顺民，速即洪业〖36〗，以宁海内。”","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":318,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":628,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{"xianzhu-p0103":{"fields":[],"directory":{"faction":"shu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
